---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="About Raghavan Muthuregunathan: Senior Engineering Manager, Search AI at LinkedIn."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="home">
			<section class="intro">
				<p class="eyebrow">About me</p>
				<h1 class="about-heading">Raghavan Muthuregunathan</h1>
				<div class="about-me about-page">
					<ul>
						<li>
							Senior Engineering Manager, Search AI at LinkedIn. I lead the teams behind global
							typeahead, the search results page, and Gen AI agents.
						</li>
						<li>
							Shipped AI People Search to 1.3B+ LinkedIn members. You can search in plain English.
							Under the hood it runs on semantic search, query routing, and small language models
							we tuned in house.
						</li>
						<li>
							10+ years in search and machine learning, at LinkedIn and at Microsoft Bing. I have
							worked on query understanding, ranking, retrieval, and whole-page layout.
						</li>
						<li>
							MS in Computer Science, Columbia University. B.Tech in Information Technology, Anna
							University (MIT campus, Madras). Named on more than 5 patents.
							<a href=https://patents.google.com/?q=(muthuregunathan)&inventor=raghavan&oq=raghavan+muthuregunathan> link </a>
						</li>
						<li>
							I care about search and assistants you can trust. That means post-training, probing
							what a model has learned inside, and testing LLM products for quality, speed, and
							cost. I also like to help engineers and managers grow.
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="profile-links" aria-label="Profile links">
					<a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=grZULY8AAAAJ&hl=en">Google Scholar</a>
					<a href="https://github.com/Raghavan1988">GitHub</a>
					<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/raghavanmit">LinkedIn</a>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer fine />
	</body>
</html>
